  "notes": "{全快|ぜんかい} is composed of {全|ぜん} (all, complete) + {快|かい} (pleasant, recovery).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {全快|ぜんかい}する: to make a full recovery\n- {全快|ぜんかい}{祝|いわ}い: celebration of recovery\n- {全快|ぜんかい}おめでとう: congratulations on your recovery\n\nSIMILAR WORDS: {回復|かいふく} (recovery) is broader and can refer to partial recovery or recovery of non-health things. {全快|ぜんかい} specifically means a complete return to health.",
